# The build context is the repository root, and the image needs two things from it: the repository's history (the
# plugin is `git archive` of a commit) and Orbit Web's own sources. Nothing else is sent to the builder.
*
!.git
!integrations/orbit-web
integrations/orbit-web/**/node_modules
integrations/orbit-web/**/dist
integrations/orbit-web/**/.spec-dist
integrations/orbit-web/**/coverage
integrations/orbit-web/**/.env
integrations/orbit-web/**/.env.*
